OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze in
OL,4,Aderelict club
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters tackled a blaze in a
OL,7,Fderelict working men's club in Swinton.
OL,9,FCrews were called to Station Street
OL,10,Fjust after 16:00 BST on Sunday, South
OL,11,FYorkshire Fire and Rescue Service said.
OL,13,FThe fire caused significant damage to
OL,14,Fthe rear roof of the building, which is
OL,15,Fopposite The Station pub.
OL,17,FAt the height of the blaze, a fire
OL,18,Fservice spokesperson said: "We are
OL,19,Fasking the public to stay away from the
OL,20,Farea and for those living nearby to
OL,21,Fkeep their doors and windows closed due
OL,22,Fto smoke in the area."
